<p>Hit the target twice with your two-handed weapon, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">58%, 62%, 65%, 67%, 70%</acronym> damage. Each hit will try to stun the target for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> turns.</p><p>The stun chance increases with your Physical Power.</p>